# Static-data image pins for the snprintf capstones (`ImageStaticsLoaded`)

Generated by `scripts/gen_image_pins.py` from `riscv64-elf-objdump -s c/while-riscv-htif.elf` — do not hand-edit.

One byte-pin predicate per static-data range the SnprintfSpec36–48 capstone
statements assume, and the umbrella conjunction `ImageStaticsLoaded`.
Discharge lemmas mapping these pins onto the exact capstone hypothesis shapes
live in `Vsa/Sim/ImageDischarge.lean`.

Ranges:

- `imgLldFmt` — [`0x800192c0`, `0x800192c8`) — the `"%lld\0"` .rodata format string (= `Code/LldFmt.lean`'s `lldFmtChunk0`; `stringify`'s int arm passes `a2 = 0x800192c0`)
- `imgDecPointStr` — [`0x80019770`, `0x80019778`) — the locale decimal-point string `"."` the `_localeconv_r` result points at
- `imgParseSlotD` — [`0x8001a20c`, `0x8001a210`) — `svfprintf`'s conversion-table `'d'` slot (`parseTableBase 0x8001a0fc + 4*(0x64-32)`): offset `-0x120f4` -> handler `0x80008008`
- `imgParseSlotL` — [`0x8001a22c`, `0x8001a230`) — `svfprintf`'s conversion-table `'l'` slot (`parseTableBase + 4*(0x6c-32)`): offset `-0x11bc8` -> handler `0x80008534`
- `imgFnSlot` — [`0x8001b880`, `0x8001b888`) — `__global_locale.mbtowc` fn-pointer slot = `0x80012268` (`__ascii_mbtowc`)
- `imgDecPointPtr` — [`0x8001b898`, `0x8001b8a0`) — the `lconv.decimal_point` pointer slot = `0x80019770`
- `imgMbCurMax` — [`0x8001b8f8`, `0x8001b8f9`) — the `__global_locale` `__mb_cur_max` byte (`= 1`, C locale)
- `imgImpurePtr` — [`0x8001b970`, `0x8001b978`) — `_impure_ptr` = `0x8001b538` (`snprintf`'s reent load)
-/

